== B3: leva LEVER-2 (mi_collect on-thread post-preludio) — REFUTATA con misura ==
protocollo=slope-probe ridotto (NON campagna): W in {1,4}, N=25*W hello
  sequenziali, /usr/bin/time -l, un run per W, stessa binaria 8e966efd6b3d3e69,
  arm da env PHPR_PRELUDE_COLLECT=1, MIMALLOC_PURGE_DELAY=0
ctrl w=1 max_rss=57294848 peak_footprint=38355472
ctrl w=4 max_rss=131219456 peak_footprint=94798400
lever w=1 max_rss=57262080 peak_footprint=38322680
lever w=4 max_rss=131235840 peak_footprint=94700096
slope ctrl (94798400-38355472)/3=18814309 B/worker
slope lever (94700096-38322680)/3=18792472 B/worker
delta slope=21837 B/worker (0.12 per cento: NULLO)
coerenza=nei raw m90 arena committed resta 151781376 (W4) e 399638528 (W16)
  anche a exit_collect_mi: mi_collect non decommitta queste pagine — la
  refutazione del probe e coerente con l'evidenza m90 gia committata
baseline build precedente (b048b697a4c10688): w1 peak_footprint=38339088
  w4 peak_footprint=94896704 (slope (94896704-38339088)/3=18852538)

